<div class="calculator" data-calculator data-kind="appliances"><form class="card" novalidate><h2>Electrodomésticos</h2><div><label for="price">Precio de energía</label><div class="input-wrap compact"><input id="price" name="price" value="0,20" inputmode="decimal"/><span>€/kWh</span></div></div><div data-appliances class="dynamic-list"><div class="dynamic-row appliance-edit"><input name="name" value="Aparato 1" aria-label="Nombre del aparato"/><select name="mode" aria-label="Modo de cálculo"><option value="hours">Potencia + horas/día</option><option value="cycle">kWh/ciclo + ciclos/semana</option></select><label data-hours-field>Potencia <span class="input-wrap"><input name="watts" value="100" inputmode="decimal"/><span>W</span></span></label><label data-hours-field>Uso diario <span class="input-wrap"><input name="hoursDay" value="5" inputmode="decimal"/><span>h/día</span></span></label><label data-cycle-field hidden>Consumo/ciclo <span class="input-wrap"><input name="kwhCycle" value="1" inputmode="decimal"/><span>kWh</span></span></label><label data-cycle-field hidden>Ciclos/semana <span class="input-wrap"><input name="cyclesWeek" value="4" inputmode="decimal"/><span>ciclos</span></span></label><button type="button" class="button tertiary" data-remove-row>Eliminar</button></div></div><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-add-appliance>Añadir aparato</button><p class="error" data-form-error></p><div class="actions"><button class="button" type="submit">Calcular consumo</button><button class="button secondary" type="reset">Restablecer</button></div></form><section class="card result"><p class="eyebrow">TU ESTIMACIÓN</p><h2>Total vivienda</h2><div id="result-output" aria-live="polite"><p>Añade tus aparatos y pulsa «Calcular consumo».</p></div></section></div><script>import '../lib/calculator-ui.mjs';</script>
